<title>UK: Turkey issues tender for 75,000 t heating oil.</title>
<headline>Turkey issues tender for 75,000 t heating oil.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish state oil company Tupras has tendered to buy three cargoes of 0.7 percent sulphur heating oil, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>One cargo is for delivery in December 20-25, one is for January 1-5 and one for January 5-10, the traders said. The cargoes are a minimum pf 25,000 tonnes each.</p>
<p>The tender closes later on Thursday and will be awarded early next week, traders said.</p>
<p>-- William Maclean, London newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
</text>
